## 5. Field Permission Matrix (documented, not enforced)
| Field | Minimum role required |
|-------|----------------------|
| substationId, name, gridZone, maintenanceSchedule | field_tech |
| controlParameters | grid_operator |
| alarmHistory | regional_admin |
